#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-modules/recommonmark.xml:24
#, xml-text
msgid "Introduction to Recommonmark Module"
msgstr "Introdução ao Módulo Recommonmark"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-modules/recommonmark.xml:27
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<application>Recommonmark</application> is a docutils-compatibility bridge "
"to CommonMark. It allows writing CommonMark inside of Docutils and Sphinx "
"projects. <application>Recommonmark</application> is now deprecated in favor"
" of <ulink url=\"https://pypi.org/project/myst-parser/\">MyST-"
"Parser</ulink>.  Unfortunately, <xref linkend=\"llvm\"/> still depends on "
"this module."
msgstr ""
"&quot;<application>Recommonmark</application>&quot; é uma ponte de "
"compatibilidade &quot;docutils&quot; para o &quot;CommonMark&quot;. Permite "
"escrever &quot;CommonMark&quot; dentro de projetos &quot;Docutils&quot; e "
"&quot;Sphinx&quot;. &quot;<application>Recommonmark</application>&quot; "
"agora está obsoleto em favor de <ulink url=\"https://pypi.org/project/myst-"
"parser/\">MyST-Parser</ulink>. Infelizmente, <xref linkend=\"llvm\"/> ainda "
"depende desse módulo."

